## Job C – Production Counter

### Python Equivalent

```python
accepted = 0
rejected = 0

for i in range(10):
    result = input("Enter result (yes/no): ").lower()

    if result == "yes":
        accepted += 1
    else:
        rejected += 1

print("Accepted:", accepted)
print("Rejected:", rejected)
print("Acceptance percentage:", accepted / 10 * 100, "%")
```

